# Model comparison (held-out TEST split)

All metrics on the held-out test split (its JDs never appear in train/val). Binary metrics use each model's validation-tuned threshold. Mean ± std over seeds where more than one seed was run. Scorer (cosine vs. interaction head) and SBERT backbone were chosen per model on VALIDATION AUC. Within-resume AUC = mean AUC over the JDs paired with each single resume; a model that ignores the JD scores exactly 0.5 there.

